msgid "Is ``setup.py`` deprecated?"
msgstr "``setup.py`` ຖືກຍົກເລີກການນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວບໍ?"

#: ../source/discussions/setup-py-deprecated.rst:8
msgid "No, :term:`setup.py` and :ref:`setuptools` are not deprecated."
