msgstr "ຄູ່ມື :ref:`modernize-setup-py-project` ມີລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເລື່ອງນີ້."

#: ../source/discussions/setup-py-deprecated.rst:198
