#: ../source/key_projects.rst:281
msgid ""
"Setuptools (which includes ``easy_install``) is a collection of enhancements "
"to the Python distutils that allow you to more easily build and distribute "
"Python :term:`distributions <Distribution Package>`, especially ones that "
"have dependencies on other packages."
msgstr ""
"Setuptools (ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ ``easy_install``) ແມ່ນຊຸດເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ເສີມປະສິດທິພາບໃຫ້ distutils ຂອງ "
"Python ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງ ແລະ ແຈກຢາຍ :term:`distributions <Distribution Package>` "
"ຂອງ Python ໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຕົວທີ່ມີສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນຈາກແພັກເກດອື່ນ."

