#: ../source/key_projects.rst:700
msgid ""
"pypiprivate serves a local (or `AWS S3`_-hosted) directory of packages as "
"a :term:`package index <Package Index>`."
msgstr "pypiprivate ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກດຈາກໂຟນເດີໃນເຄື່ອງ (ຫຼື AWS S3) ໃນຮູບແບບດັດຊະນີແພັກເກດ."

#: ../source/key_projects.rst:706
