#: ../source/specifications/dependency-specifiers.rst:725
msgid ""
"Resolving inconsistencies between actual tool behavior and the nominal "
"definitions of environment marker field comparisons (https://"
"discuss.python.org/t/spec-change-bugfix-dependency-specifiers-simplification-"
"pep-508/105203)"
