"The following JSON Schema can be used to validate the contents of "
"``direct_url.json``:"
msgstr "JSON Schema ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອມວດສອບເນື້ອຫາຂອງ ``direct_url.json``:"

