"Securely Download `get-pip.py <https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py>`_ [1]_"
msgstr ""
"ດາວໂຫຼດ `get-pip.py <https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py>`_ ຢ່າງປອດໄພ [1]_"

