msgid ""
"For more information, see the :doc:`venv <python:library/venv>` docs or "
"the :doc:`virtualenv <virtualenv:index>` docs."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ :doc:`venv <python:library/venv>` "
